    {
      "id": "253:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58026:58028"
    },
    {
      "id": "253:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你握住华丽匕首的刀柄。它威力无穷。你感觉自己威力无穷。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58028:58057"
    },
    {
      "id": "253:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你在门边站好，握着匕首，你准备好了。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58057:58077"
    },
    {
      "id": "253:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "只过了几秒钟，门砰地被撞开，陌生人走了进来。他朝着你冲来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58077:58108"
    },
    {
      "id": "253:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "在记录表上勾选 临阵磨刀。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58108:58123"
    },
    {
      "id": "253:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "转到 259。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:58123:58132"
    }
  ]
}
